Subject: [PATCH] dts: apple: t[603x,8122]: Add MCA and supporting nodes

Signed-off-by: Sasha Finkelstein <k@chaosmail.tech>
(cherry picked from commit 86610d5d68c4d274217294263e9b7d4b402d301f)
